//! Parser rule-body emit: recursive descent, static scan, multi-alt
//! dispatch, and the LR climb, per rule of a `LoweredGrammar`.
//! Not here: scaffolding (`parser_runtime_gen`), actions (`action_gen`),
//! token-set tables (`kind_set_gen`), naming leaves (`gen_util`).

